            reasoning: "If roots have filled the pot, there is no room or fresh soil left to support new growth.",
            inspect: ["Are roots coming out of the drainage holes?", "Does water run straight through the pot?"],
            actions: ["Repot into a pot one size larger with fresh potting mix.", "Tease out circling roots gently before repotting."],
            avoid: "Do not jump to a much bigger pot — one size up is enough.",
